- W>R | invite them to the big family barbecue in the summer | v: benevolence, hedonism | mark: made a friend | chance: 55
- U>G | write them a long letter about what that summer meant, and close the door gently | v: benevolence | chance: 82
- B>W | use the message to make your partner jealous and attentive again | v: security, power | chance: 50
- R>U | go alone to the town where you met, to see how it feels now | v: self-direction, stimulation | chance: 90
- G>B | decide it was meant to be, and start seeing them in secret | v: hedonism, self-direction | mark: hid a wrong | closed: approval: deceiving a partner; backfire: found out, and a marriage in crisis | chance: 65
