== a sleepless night: is this all there is?
tier: everyday
stages: mature
age: 40-65
calls: URG
tone: trouble
life: inner
horizon: moment
roles: partner, rival, friend
earth: three in the morning, the house is quiet, and the thought will not go away: twenty more years of exactly this?
