scene W: {N} has done everything right: the job, the home, the family, the duties. Lying here, {N} wonders who it was all for.
scene U: {N} goes back over the decades like a ledger, looking for the year when the plan stopped being {Ns} own.
scene B: {N} thinks of {rival}, who walked out at forty and now has the life {N} wanted. Why them, and not {N}?
scene R: {Ns} heart is racing in the dark. Something has to change, or {N} will scream.
scene G: Outside, a fox calls across the gardens. {N} listens, and wonders whether every life feels like this halfway through.
- W | count up what your years of duty have kept standing, and tell yourself it is enough | v: tradition, conformity | chance: 65
- U | get up and write out a plan for the next twenty years, step by step | v: self-direction | chance: 72
- B | decide that from tomorrow you will start taking what you want | identity | v: power, self-direction | chance: 60
- R | ring or wake the one person you can tell, and pour it all out | v: none clear (feeling let out) | chance: 88
- G | open the window, listen to the night, and let the question be | v: universalism (wisdom) | chance: 75
- W>G | book a week's silent retreat, with set hours and plain meals | door | v: universalism (wisdom), tradition | chance: 85
- U>W | read the old philosophers, and draw up rules for the rest of your life | habit | v: self-direction, conformity | tags: commit:faith | chance: 55
- B>U | use every contact you have to get a place on the course you always wanted | door | v: self-direction | chance: 78
- R>B | decide, there and then, to start the business you always talked about | binds | v: self-direction, achievement | chance: 50
- G>R | walk barefoot in the wet garden until the sky grows light | v: stimulation, universalism (nature) | body: light | chance: 90
works: By dawn something in {N} has settled, and the day ahead feels lighter.
works: The night ends with a decision, and {N} keeps it.
fails: Morning comes, and the question is still there, heavier than before.
fails: {N} snaps at everyone the next day, and cannot say why.

